<%--
_Sys_Task_Detail - one run, in three columns: its facts and lifecycle actions, its live
output, and the reports it has set. The body of the run dialog (_Sys_Task_Detail.open(id))
and of the full-page view (_Sys_Task_View_Action).

$task_id - the run (required)

The shell itself never re-renders - the console in the middle keeps its scrollback - and each
column follows the run on its own: _Sys_Task_Facts and _Sys_Task_Reports_Pane on
Task_Changed_Topic, Task_Output on Task_Output_Topic.
--%>
<Define:_Sys_Task_Detail tag="div">
    <% if (!this.args.task_id) { throw new Error('_Sys_Task_Detail requires $task_id'); } %>
    <div class="_Sys_Task_Detail__facts">
        <_Sys_Task_Facts $sid="facts" $task_id=this.args.task_id />
    </div>
    <div class="_Sys_Task_Detail__output">
        <div class="_Sys_Task_Detail__heading">Output</div>
        <Task_Output class="_Sys_Task_Detail__console" $task_id=this.args.task_id />
    </div>
    <div class="_Sys_Task_Detail__reports">
        <_Sys_Task_Reports_Pane $task_id=this.args.task_id />
    </div>
</Define:_Sys_Task_Detail>
